d\",\"titl"),
    TEXT("e\":\"Drift\",\"title_ko\":\"\\ub4dc\\ub9ac\\ud504\\ud2b8\"},{\"art\":\"res://assets/cg/generated/archive_ch4_reading_loss_v1.png\",\"chapter\":4,\"desc\":\"Words move when they shouldn't. A known side effect, Tobias says. 'Recovery not guaranteed.'\",\"desc_ko\":\"\\uac00\\ub9cc\\ud788 \\uc788\\uc5b4\\uc57c \\ud560 \\uae00\\uc790\\uac00 \\uc6c0\\uc9c1\\uc778\\ub2e4. \\uc54c\\ub824\\uc9c4 \\ubd80\\uc791\\uc6a9\\uc774\\ub77c\\uace0 \\ud1a0\\ube44\\uc544\\uc2a4\\ub294 \\ub9d0\\ud588\\ub2e4. '\\ud68c\\ubcf5\\uc740 \\ubcf4\\uc7a5\\ub418\\uc9c0 \\uc54a\\uc2b5\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.'\",\"flag\":\"ch4_reading_loss\",\"title\":\"Reading Deterioration\",\"title_ko\":\"\\uc77d\\uae30 \\uc800\\ud558\"},{\"art\":\"res://assets/cg/generated/archive_drift_anchoring_v1.png\",\"chapter\":4,\"desc\":\"Warm hands. The smell of bread. A page pressed back into its binding. Elia tethers the architecture.\",\"desc_ko\":\"\\ub530\\ub73b\\ud55c \\uc190. \\ube75 \\ub0c4\\uc0c8. \\uc81c\\ubcf8 \\uc548\\uc73c\\ub85c \\ub2e4\\uc2dc \\ub20c\\ub7ec \\ub123\\uc740 \\ud55c \\uc7a5. \\uc5d8\\ub9ac\\uc544\\uac00 \\uad6c\\uc870\\ub97c \\ubd99\\ub4e4\\uc5b4 \\ub9e8\\ub2e4.\",\"flag\":\"ch4_anchoring\",\"title\":\"Anchoring Session\",\"title_ko\":\"\\uc575\\ucee4\\ub9c1\"},{\"chapter\":5,\"desc\":\"Where land forgets how to be solid. Salt air and dissolved memory leaching into the sea.\",\"desc_ko\":\"\\ub545\\uc774 \\ub2e8\\ub2e8\\ud574\\uc9c0\\ub294 \\ubc95\\uc744 \\uc78a\\uc740 \\uacf3. \\uc18c\\uae08\\uae30 \\ubc34 \\uacf5\\uae30\\uc640, \\ub179\\uc544 \\ubc14\\ub2e4\\ub85c \\uc2a4\\uba70\\ub4dc\\ub294 \\uae30\\uc5b5.\",\"flag\":\"ch5_arrived\",\"title\":\"The Crumbling Coast\",\"title_ko\":\"\\ubb34\\ub108\\uc9c0\\ub294 \\ud574\\uc548\"},{\"art\":\"res://assets/portraits/character_shots/kairos_edit_v3.png\",\"chapter\":5,\"desc\":\"A figure on the ridge. Still as stone. Not chasing, classifying. Elia said that was worse.\",\"desc_ko\":\"\\ub2a5\\uc120 \\uc704\\uc758 \\ud615\\uccb4. \\ub3cc\\ucc9